Note, sprites with real images, movement and collision detection.
Note, run this from the project folder so that the images are found.

Open window with title Sprites.
Add canvas board with width 480 and height 320.

Add sprite bird with image examples slash images slash bird.png.
Add sprite pipe with image examples slash images slash pipe.png.

Set position of bird to 40 by 140.
Set position of pipe to 400 by 120.

Every 30 milliseconds, do the following.
Move sprite bird by 3 by 0.
Move sprite pipe by 0 by 0.
If sprite bird collides with sprite pipe, do the following.
Say The bird hit the pipe.
Remove sprite bird.
Stop ticking.
End if.
If the x of bird is greater than 470, do the following.
Say The bird escaped.
Stop ticking.
End if.
End every.
